From ec33cf8fcce45a8cd928db47a5b6d983573d28d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: coldshalamov <93robingattis@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 21:21:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(perf): pre-allocate bloom target pool; dyn-res via
 content sub-rects

Bloom/post render targets stay at max size. setContentScale shrinks the
active viewport/scissor sub-rect and remaps downsample/composite UVs so
scale changes never call setSize/realloc (PERF backlog #89).
